{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:1815","original":"The \"Wonderful Shrine Maiden of Paradise\" and main character of the [[Touhou]] series.\r\n\r\nAn easygoing but dutiful [[nontraditional miko|miko]] and good friend to fellow protagonist [[Kirisame Marisa]]; her cool, detached facade belies a sympathetic personality which often wins her the friendship of her former enemies, such as [[Remilia Scarlet]]. Reimu takes care of the rundown [[Hakurei Shrine]], which lay near [[Gensokyo]]'s border with the outside world and acts as its main portal, and fights using her [[gohei]], [[ofuda]], and her family heirloom, [[yin yang orb]]s.\r\n\r\nFamous for her laid-back disposition and exposed [[armpits]], as well as the first subject (together with Marisa) of a notorious [[2channel]] meme - \"[[Yukkuri shiteitte ne|]]!!!\".\r\n\r\nHer hair color is usually [[brown hair|brown]] or [[black hair|black]] of nearly every length and her eye colors varies between [[red eyes|red]], [[black eyes|black]], or [[brown eyes|brown]]. Her signature accessories are her [[frilled bow|frilled]] [[red bow|red]] [[hair bow]], her [[frilled hair tubes]] on her [[sidelocks]], and her [[yellow ascot]]. Her outfit is a [[sleeveless shirt|sleeveless]] [[red shirt]] (that is sometimes depicted either as [[crop top|cropped]] or otherwise baring [[midriff]] or having a [[white shirt|white]] [[undershirt]]) with a [[frilled shirt collar|frilled collar]], [[detached sleeves|detached]] [[white sleeves]] with a [[ribbon-trimmed sleeves|ribbon trim]], a [[skirt set|matching]] [[frilled skirt|frilled]] [[red skirt]], [[white socks]], and either [[brown shoes|brown]] [[loafers]] or [[black shoes|black]] [[mary janes]]. \r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #196159: Default\r\n* !post #6586872: [[Unfinished Dream of All Living Ghost]]\r\n* !asset #24498417: [[Unconnected Marketeers]]\r\n* !post #3997647: Outfit guide (up to [[Wily Beast and Weakest Creature]])\r\n* !post #1275123: [[Hakurei Reimu (PC-98)|PC-98]]\r\n* !post #8244536: [[Hakurei Reimu (Seihou)|Seihou]] \r\n* !post #6714582: [[Touhou Gensou Eclipse]]\r\n* !post #6842479: [[Hakurei Reimu (God-Summoning Shaman)|God-Summoning Shaman]] ([[Touhou LostWord]])\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Hakurei Reimu (PC-98)]]\r\n* [[Hakurei Reimu (Seihou)]]\r\n* [[Gensokyo's First Hakurei Miko]]\r\n* [[Sendai Hakurei no Miko]]\r\n* [[Reimu Day]] (6th January and 9th August)\r\n* [[Hakurei shrine]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Touhou Wiki: Reimu Hakurei\":http://en.touhouwiki.net/wiki/Reimu_Hakurei \r\n* \"Pixiv Encyclopedia (EN): Reimu Hakurei\":[http://en.dic.pixiv.net/a/Reimu+Hakurei]\r\n* \"Pixiv Encyclopedia (JP): 博麗霊夢\":[https://dic.pixiv.net/a/博麗霊夢]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"hakurei_reimu"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:12239","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"native_identity","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":12239},{"active_alias_ids":[],"coverage":"scoped_complete","evidence_id":"scope:hakurei_reimu","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:38.689447+00:00","name":"hakurei_reimu","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945.raw","raw_sha256":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","role":"canonical_scope","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f"},{"association":"official embedded tag.wiki_page","evidence_id":"wiki:6109","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path"